<title>SINGAPORE: Singapore power plans to bid for domestic phone licence in 1997.</title>
<headline>Singapore power plans to bid for domestic phone licence in 1997.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>State power monopoly, Singapore Power plans to form a consortium to bid for a telephone service license in 1997 when Singapore liberalises its telecommunication sector, said chairman Ho Kwon-Ping on Friday.</p>
</text>
